      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for python-joserfc fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in python-joserfc:\n\n- CVE-2026-119283: Limit the maximum number of recipients in JWE General\n  JSON Serialization to prevent CPU exhaustion. (bsc#1288948)\n- CVE-2026-119824: Reject recognized DER, PEM, and SSH asymmetric public\n  keys when importing oct keys. (bsc#1288947)\n",
